WEBVTT

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.120
(SQUEALS)
(IMPACT GRUNT)

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:09.160
I am a master of the
ancient Shaolin art of kung fu.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.800
Aah!

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.040
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.320
(EFFORT GRUNT)
(THUD)

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.480
(FIGHTING GRUNTS)

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.920
(YELLS)

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.200
(THUD)

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.560
Huh?
(CLANG) (IMPACT GROAN)

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.480
(REPEATED GRUNTING)

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.160
Ha-ha!
(THUD)

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.400
(FIGHTING GRUNTS)

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.520
(GROWLS)

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.960
(HAPPY MUTTERINGS)

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Get lost!
(CHUCKLES)

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.480
(LAUGHS)
(BLOWS RASPBERRY) (GIGGLES)

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:48.800
If you come back to our place,
you're dead!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.720
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.640
(DOOR JANGLES)
Ah, thank you.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.520
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:01.200
Shh, shh, shh.
You can thank me by going away.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.360
I'm working.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.240
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:07.320
YOU want to learn kung fu?

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:08.680
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.760
Ah, Kevin.
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:16.240
Hm-hm.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.280
(SLAP)
Ow!

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.440
(YELLS MINIONESE)

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.480
(WHOOSH)
Argh!

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:25.720
My teaching days are over.
This is my life now.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.280
(WHIMPERS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.920
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.400
(THEY WHIMPER)

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:45.680
Ai-ya. Fine.
I will teach you.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.960
(CHEER) (LAUGH)

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.400
Hey!
(GASPS) Huh?

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.360
Those are not for you.
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:56.560
The name of the game
is sell, sell, sell!

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:01.080
(WHIMPERS)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:03.240
(TRUMPING SOUND)
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.080
(TUNEFUL TRUMPING)

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.840
(THEY VOCALISE)

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.880
(PANICKED MUTTERINGS)

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:11.280
What?!

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.320
(CLUNK)

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.960
(EFFORT GRUNTS)
(SCREAMS)

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.400
(THUD)
(GROWLS)

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.880
(SCREAMING)

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.200
Where's Gru?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.040
Huh, how should I know?
What's with the costumes?

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.040
Halloween was four months ago,
you look stupid!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.000
Buzz off! Shoo!
Ugh!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.360
I'm getting my meat tenderizer!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.080
Let me help you with that, dearie.
Ah-ah-ah! Don't touch me!

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.960
Now, where's the boy?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.480
(PANICKED MINIONESE)

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:42.320
Oh, I didn't mean to scare you.
Don't worry.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:47.400
We're not mad at him.
We just want to... hire him.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.960
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.600
Where is he?
(CLANG)

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:53.760
Wild Knuckles... San Francisco.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:55.480
Wild Knuckles is alive?

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:58.320
And working with the kid. Hmm.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.760
We're going to San Francisco.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.960
(CHUCKLES)
Let's hit it!

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.240
(HEAVENLY MUSIC)

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.600
You had better be
paying for my roof!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.520
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.040
(GASPS)
Pretty groovy, huh?

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.480
(SPEAK MINIONESE)

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:20.160
(DOOR BANGS)
(FIGHTING YELL)

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.040
We begin with a basic kick.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.760
(FIGHTING YELL)
Now you.

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:29.600
Ha-ya.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.640
Ya!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.280
OK. No kicking.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:36.200
This is a melon hammer.
It's a weapon.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:37.680
This is Fred.

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:41.320
He is a dummy.
Never underestimate a dummy.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
Hello, Fred!

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.080
Now attack!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:48.120
(YELLING)
(CLANGING)

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:52.160
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:55.200
Yeah! Woo-hoo!
Stuart, Stuart! Woo-hoo!

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.760
(IMPACT THUDS)

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.360
(BIRDS TWITTER)

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.040
(GROANS) (GASPS)

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.080
(POP)

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:06.640
(GRUMBLES IN MINIONESE)

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.960
Doubt tells me
I cannot break this wood.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.720
Uh-hm.
But doubt exists only in the mind.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.680
You know what I say to my mind?

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.440
Wa-ya!
(CRUNCH)

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:19.880
Now you.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:22.600
(MUMBLES IN MINIONESE)
Mm-hmm.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.240
(STUTTERS, MUMBLES)

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.200
Ya!
(THUD)

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.000
Ooh!
(THUDDING)

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.360
(PAINED GROANS)

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.720
(SIGHS)
Kevin, Kevin, Kevin.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.720
Hmmmm.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.920
(THUDDING)
(SCREAMS)

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.120
(FIGHTING GROANS)

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.200
(CURSING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.760
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.440
(WHOOSH)
(WHIMPERS)

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:52.040
OK. Clearly,
we are not ready for philosophy.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.360
Let's just train.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:57.080
Ha-hoo! Ha-hoo!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.840
Ha-hoo! Ha-hoo!

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.720
Ha-hoo!

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.600
Ho-hey!
# St. Vincent: FUNKYTOWN #

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:07.080
Ho, hey, hoo! Ho, hey...

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.320
(SLAP)

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:10.680
Whoa, whoa, whoa. OK, OK, OK. Yah...

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:13.400
Yah.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:17.040
Yah...
# St. Vincent: FUNKYTOWN #

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.640
Yah, hoo, yah, hoo.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.640
Yah, hoo...

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:26.160
(SLAPS)
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.680
(SHOUTS MINIONESE)

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:32.640
Rest up!
Tomorrow's going to be even worse.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.320
WILD KNUCKLES:
What, you're quitting?

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:39.000
I told you! When I get that stone,
we're gonna be unstoppable.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.840
I have had enough!

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.160
There's nothing sadder
than an aging villain.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.960
So long, old man!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.160
Guys, come on! We're a team!
(DOOR BANGS)

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.880
# Andrea True: MORE, MORE, MORE #
(MUSIC FADES)

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.240
How do you like it?
How do you like... (GROANS)

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:01.720
Is this heaven?

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:04.440
I just had to fire my henchmen.
You know why?

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.480
'Cause they weren't
getting the job done.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:10.040
OK, I'm just gonna untie you now
because I, I, uh...

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:13.040
I need you to do some stuff
for me around the house.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.120
And it might be, you know,
uh, kinda nice to have

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.840
a, a little company around here.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:22.600
Oh. Oh, yeah.
Two villains just doing some chores!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.160
Who knows what kind of trouble
we could get into?

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:26.800
(LAUGHS) (GRUNTS)

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:29.280
What's that?
That's your evil chuckle?

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.880
Obviously.
Well, it stinks.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:34.200
You sound like a clown
who swallowed a kazoo.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:38.560
Really? Well, you look like a wizard
going through an end-of-life crisis!

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.280
(YELLS)
Easy there, Don Rickles.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:42.760
Who's Don Rickles?

